&"id": "17",
&"next_id": "18",
&"text": "....",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"18": {
&"character": "Evil pineapple",
&"id": "18",
&"next_id": "19",
&"text": "Since I could not get yours money, so you are useless to me now.",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"19": {
&"character": "You",
&"id": "19",
&"next_id": "20",
&"text": "So could I get my Pc back to normal?",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"2": {
&"character": "You",
&"id": "2",
&"next_id": "3",
&"text": "What the heck.",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"20": {
&"character": "Evil pineapple",
&"id": "20",
&"next_id": "21",
&"text": "NO!",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"21": {
&"character": "Evil pineapple",
&"id": "21",
&"next_id": "22",
&"text": "I could but I don't want to.",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"22": {
&"character": "Evil pineapple",
&"id": "22",
&"next_id": "23",
&"text": "Well, if you want your PC back to normal again, you need to find a number in each file that I secretly installed in your computer",
&"type": "dialogue"
},
"23": {
&"character": "Evil pineapple",
&"id": "23",
&"next_id": "24",
&"text": "If you find all the number, you could uninstall me.",
