raw_text = "~ start
...: Hello.
You: What the heck.
...: Let me introduct myself.
Evil pineapple: I'm an evil pineapple and I'm computure virus.
Evil pineapple: And I will distory yours computure.
You: Nuh uh.
Evil pineapple: ?
Evil pineapple: Huh?
You: I said nuh uh.
You: You are not going to distory my computure.
Evil pineapple: ohhhhh, will see about that.
Evil pineapple: I will stole every yours money from yours bank account.
You: Go ahead, I only have 20.4 dollars in my bank account.
Evil pineapple: Wait what?
Evil pineapple: But I saw you having more than 100 games on yours computure.
You: Well that is the reason why I only have 20 bucks.
Evil pineapple: ....
Evil pineapple: Since I could not get yours money, so you are useless to me now.
You: So could I get my Pc back to normal?
Evil pineapple: NO!
Evil pineapple: I could but I don't want to.
Evil pineapple: Well, if you want your PC back to normal again, you need to find a number in each file that I secretly installed in your computer
Evil pineapple: If you find all the number, you could uninstall me.
Evil pineapple: BUT, this ain't tho.
You: Wait why you were helping me now.
Evil pineapple: Because you were useless to me, since I could get yours money, so there is no point for staying in yours PC.
You: But why don't you delete yourself then?
Evil pineapple: Because I'm still want to waste yours time XD.
Evil pineapple: Okay in short find a numbe, unlock a new file and boom yours PC is back.
Evil pineapple: Easy, right?
You: ...
You: Oki
=> END"
